Columns: gpu_wall = max over ranks of last kernel end - min first kernel start; sumbusy = sum of 4 ranks' busy (NOT a critical path); slowbusy = busy of the rank that finishes last; compute/comm_u/wait/idle/ovlp shown for the rank with the largest compute; intrins = sum over collective calls of min-over-ranks duration; wait = per-rank collective time above intrinsic; skew = sum over calls of start spread; hostskw = spread of the 'forward' NVTX start across ranks; gpu0skw = spread of first kernel start across ranks.

